---
// Testimonials — featured-first quote grid.
---
<section class="sec" id="clients">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="kicker">Signal</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title">What clients say.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lead reveal" data-d="1">A few words from the people and teams we've built for.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="quotes">
      <figure class="quote feature reveal">
        <div class="qmark">"</div>
        <p>They automated a process that ate two full days a week. It now runs overnight and we never think about it.</p>
        <figcaption class="who"><span class="av">MR</span><span><span class="nm">Maria Reyes</span><span class="rl">Ops Lead · Northwind</span></span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="quote reveal" data-d="1">
        <div class="qmark">"</div>
        <p>Idea to live product in six weeks. Clean code, clear communication, zero drama. We'd hire them again in a heartbeat.</p>
        <figcaption class="who"><span class="av">JO</span><span><span class="nm">James Okafor</span><span class="rl">Founder · Tindr Labs</span></span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="quote reveal" data-d="2">
        <div class="qmark">"</div>
        <p>I had no website and no idea where to start. A week later my business was online and looked better than my competitors.</p>
        <figcaption class="who"><span class="av">SK</span><span><span class="nm">Sana Khan</span><span class="rl">Owner · Saffron Studio</span></span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
